---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Enrollment
description: "How to enroll at Precious Steps in Plainfield, NJ. Tour, application, documents, subsidies and what to expect, step by step."
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Enrollment</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">How to join us</h1>
    <p class="hero__lead">
      Enrollment starts with a conversation and a visit. Here is what the
      process looks like from your first call to your child's first day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>Step by step</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      {% for step in enrollment.steps %}
        <li>
          <p class="steps__title">{{ step.title }}</p>
          <p>{{ step.detail }}</p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--subtle">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>What we will need</h2>
    <ul>
      {% for doc in enrollment.documents %}
        <li>{{ doc }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p>
      An updated copy of your child's immunization record must be given to the
      center after each doctor visit.
    </p>
    <div class="todo">
      <strong>Decision needed</strong>
      {{ enrollment.publishApplicationPdfNote }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>Tuition</h2>
    <p>{{ enrollment.pricing.message }}</p>

    <h2>Subsidies and assistance</h2>
    <p>{{ enrollment.subsidies.message }} We will help you request or transfer yours during enrollment.</p>

    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>{{ enrollment.openings.status }}</p>

    <h2>Tours and open house</h2>
    <p>{{ enrollment.openHouse }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--subtle">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>Health and safety</h2>
    <p>
      Both centers have secure entrances, cameras throughout, and burglar and
      fire alarms, and we run regular fire and intruder drills. All staff clear
      a Child Abuse Record Inquiry and a Criminal History Record Inquiry and are
      trained in CPR and First Aid.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our full health policies, including when to keep a child home, medication
      procedures and our discipline philosophy, are set out in the Parent
      Handbook.
    </p>
    <div class="todo">
      <strong>Awaiting file</strong>
      Link the current Parent Handbook PDF here once the client sends the revised
      version. Place it in src/assets/docs/. Do not restate handbook policy text
      on the site: summarize and link, so the handbook stays the single source
      of truth.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--ruled">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>Questions parents ask</h2>
    {% for item in faq %}
      {% if item.a %}
        <details class="faq__item">
          <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
          <p>{{ item.a }}</p>
        </details>
      {% else %}
        <div class="todo">
          <strong>Answer needed: {{ item.q }}</strong>
          {{ item.sourceNote }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
